### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

June 8, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-34-21 for furnishing One (1) New 2021-2022 Horizontal
Mobile wood waste grinder, for the City of Cheyenne, Sanitation/Compost Division
______________________________________________
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The One (1) Bid was received from:
1. Rotochopper. Albany, Minnesota.
a. (Bid In Compliance, No Bid Exceptions).

The bid was reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), Matt
Theriault (Landfill and Compost Manager), and Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance).  Their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Rotochopper, for One (1) New 2021-
2022 Horizontal Mobile wood waste grinder, Less Trade In, Plus ABI 3 for Fire Suppression
System, for a bid award amount of $389,707.00.

Funding:
023-14-1423-43-43102 (Solid Waste Fund / Equipment)

Total $389,707.00
```

